      "texto": "(RBT12 × alíquota nominal − parcela a deduzir) ÷ RBT12 = (R$ 500.000,00 × 13,50% − R$ 17.640,00) ÷ R$ 500.000,00 = 9,9720%.",
      "fonte": "LC 123/2006, art. 18, § 1º-A",
